SUMMARY:Dave Gunning – Healing Garden Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:Close the 28th season with us at Acoustic Harvest. \nJoin us on Saturday\, May 23 for our final concert of the season\, a special evening with acclaimed Nova Scotia singer-songwriter Dave Gunning\, presented as a fundraiser in support of the Healing Garden project to create gardens of solace in hospital settings for patients undergoing the rigours of cancer. \nAcoustic Harvest has always been more than a concert series. It is a place to hear outstanding artists\, but also a place to meet friends\, share conversation\, and feel part of a warm musical community. This season-closing show is a chance to gather one more time before summer. \nDave Gunning is one of Canada’s most respected folk singer-songwriters. A multiple East Coast Music Award and Canadian Folk Music Award winner\, he is known for his warm stage presence\, sharp wit\, heartfelt storytelling\, and songs that honour everyday people and hard truths. \nThe evening opens with Taivi & Garth\, setting the tone for a night of music\, friendship\, and community. \nCome for the songs. Come for the cause. Come to close the season with us. \nOpening Set: Taivi & Garth\nDave Gunning: Healing Garden Fundraiser\nFinal Acoustic Harvest concert of the season
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/dave-gunning-healing-garden-fundraiser/
LOCATION:St. Paul’s United Church\, 200 McIntosh St.\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/20193040/David_Gunning.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Acoustic Harvest":MAILTO:acousticharvest@proton.me
END:VEVENT
